OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifting reports spike as
OL,4,Apolice 'build trust'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have expressed the hope that a
OL,7,F10-year high in shoplifting reports in
OL,8,FWarwickshire is a sign that people are
OL,9,Fmore confident in reporting incidents.
OL,11,FFigures gathered by the BBC Data Unit
OL,12,Fsuggest the county had the fourth
OL,13,Fbiggest rise in shoplifting offences in
OL,14,Fthe last year of any force in England.
OL,16,FIn the year to April 2026 there were
OL,17,F3,869 shoplifting offences recorded, a
OL,18,Frise of close to 10% on the previous
OL,19,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
