OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifting reports spike as
OL,4,Apolice 'build trust'
OL,5,
OL,6,FInspector Ryan Walker from Warwickshire
OL,7,FPolice said: "I welcome those figures,
OL,8,Fit could be seen as a negative, but we
OL,9,Fare also here to build trust and
OL,10,Fconfidence with the public, so it could
OL,11,Fbe that more people are reporting those
OL,12,Fcrimes."
